# REGENT OF TAMBRAUW

# WEST PAPUA PROVINCE

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF TAMBRAUW REGENCY

# NUMBER  3   YEAR 2016

# CONCERNING

# PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE

# BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

# REGENT OF TAMBRAUW,

Considering:  
that acts and treatment of violence against women and children constitute actions that violate the rights and dignity of women and children as human beings;  

that the implementation of prevention and protection of women and children as victims of acts of violence in Tambrauw Regency has not been carried out optimally;  

that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children From Acts of Violence;  

In View of:

#### Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;  

Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention on The Flimination of All Form of Discrimination against women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1984 Number 29, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3668);  

Law Number 10 of 1992 concerning Population Development and Prosperous Family Development (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1992 Number 35, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3475);  

Law Number 21 of 1999 concerning Ratification of the ILO Convention Concerning Discrimination in Employment and Occupation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1992 Number 57, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3836);  

Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);  

Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);  

Law Number 56 of 2008 concerning Establishment of Tambrauw Regency in West Papua Province (State Gazette Year 2008 Number 193, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 4940), as amended by Law Number 14 of 2013 concerning Amendment to Law Number 56 of 2008 Concerning Establishment of Tambrauw Regency in West Papua Province (State Gazette Year 2013 Number 85, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 5416);  

Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning Formation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);  

Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as amended by Law Number 9 of 2015 concerning Second Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);  

Government Regulation Number 38 of 2007 concerning Division of Government Affairs between the Government, Provincial Regional Government and Regency/Municipal Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 8, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4734);  

Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 80 of 2015 concerning Formation of Regional Legal Products (State News of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2015 Number 2036);  

With Mutual Approval

##### REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF TAMBRAUW REGENCY

##### REGENT OF TAMBRAUW

##### HAS DECIDED:

To Establish:  	REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE.
